    "name": "cambra-inspector/examples/mutation_loop.chl",
    "text": "# Mutable accumulator loop (RT-4 letrec shape). The loop body reads the\n# accumulator at two sites (`total + total`), so the induction phase substitutes\n# the read-your-writes value twice per step — the copies (and the step_view\n# scaffolding clones) must carry freshened (unique) NodeIds.\ntotal := 0\nfor i in [1, 2, 3]:\n    total := total + total + i\ntotal\n"
